<title>BELGIUM: Belgian industrial output up 2.0 % yr/yr in June.</title>
<headline>Belgian industrial output up 2.0 % yr/yr in June.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Statistics Office released the following indices for production in industry excluding the construction sector -</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION	   JUNE 96     MAY 96	  JUNE 95</p>
<p> work day index (1990=100) (*)  106.9	103.8	    104.8</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) index per working day, adjusted for length and composition of the months  </p>
<p> SEASONALLY ADJUSTED INDICES(*) JUNE 96    MAY 96   JUNE 95</p>
<p>industry as a whole		 93.6	 93.4	94.6</p>
<p>construction industry	     75.3	 75.1	86.8</p>
<p>investment goods		   100.0	 99.6	98.2</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) seasonally adjusted based on averages of the last 12 months. -- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
